: \"ActionButton\",\n   \"kind\": \"part\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"Toaster\",\n   \"kind\": \"part\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"StatusBadge\",\n   \"kind\": \"part\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"Notice\",\n   \"kind\": \"part\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"AvatarStack\",\n   \"kind\": \"part\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"Tip\",\n   \"kind\": \"part\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"Tabs\",\n   \"kind\": \"part\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"Crumbs\",\n   \"kind\": \"part\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"Pager\",\n   \"kind\": \"part\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"AppFrame\",\n   \"kind\": \"part\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"name\": \"ScreenShell\",\n   \"kind\": \"part\"\n  }\n ]\n}\n</artifact>\n\nList the screens and choose the look; the pages are drawn next."}